Z||000012||Jay||06-19-2001||04:41 PM||||Looks great guys, wish I could come but Mondays are no good for me.  BTW every Wednesday night, at the other end of Toronto between Port Perry and Whitby there is a show and shine that has over 500 cars show up.  Anyone interested in coming?  They have two areas pre 79 and also 80 and up.    It is held at a rib and chicken place that owns a large farm.  They clear the area to alow cars to pull up on the grass every Wednesday.  Great time, lots of give aways. ||||reg||1
Z||000013||grinthock||06-19-2001||06:15 PM||||Sounds cool Jay, again, wish I could make it, but that means driving to burlington picking up the Fiero and driving back, just aint gonna happen, JOE! NICE PICS!  Looks great... I hope we can all make it NEXT week too!  IT was a GREAT show this week 50/50 was $85 !! and lots of prizes, free food, all sorts.... NEXT WEEK FREE TOOLS!!!  Tool giveaways!!!  <P><BR>The show is FREE To come in, NO money even to win the prizes!! All donations and 50/50 goto the Optimist club youth foundation||||reg||1
